# ===== Rust / Cargo build artifacts =====
# Compiled output, incremental caches, fingerprints, deps — never commit these.
/target/
/debug/

# rustfmt backup files
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# ===== Profiling / coverage output =====
*.profraw
*.profdata
/coverage/

# ===== Cargo.lock =====
# Deliberately NOT ignored: tcac is a binary crate, so the lockfile should be
# committed for reproducible builds. (Libraries are the ones that ignore it.)

# ===== Environment & secrets =====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ===== Editor / IDE =====
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ===== OS junk files =====
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
